# CORS — origins allowed to call this API from a browser. Comma-separated,
# must match the exact origin (no trailing slash). Read by ignis-app's own Go
# CORS middleware, which also answers preflight requests; nothing else consumes
# it. This list does not restrict server-to-server callers, which send no
# Origin header: what limits who can reach ignis is the port mapping in the
# compose file.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:5174,http://127.0.0.1:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5174,http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8000,http://127.0.0.1:8000,https://thd-spatial-ai.github.io
